      "writtenOn": "2026-09-16T08:16:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So it is possible all MMIO pages in [phys, phys + size) are already borrowed? If so, then we can skip the following pkvm_pgtable_map() to set borrowed again?",
      "revId": "8e2aad8e44e7edcc11b3696972c43bfbfa4242b1",
